{"sha": "9f13245a8476d06d773279570a558fa033b1b8b55b622f56341c469f5f7f9406", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:optical-instruments} 章 --- 光学仪器与眼睛}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:1}", "无穷远：$f' = \\qty{17}{mm}$，$V = 1/0.017 = \\qty{58.8}{\\delta}$。", "\\qty{25}{cm}：$V = 58.8 + 1/0.25 = \\qty{62.8}{\\delta}$，$f' = \\qty{15.9}{mm}$。", "调节幅度 \\qty{4.0}{\\delta}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:2}", "近视：无穷远处的物须成像于远点，$f' = \\qty{-40}{cm}$，", "$V = \\qty{-2.5}{\\delta}$。远视：位于 \\qty{25}{cm} 处的物体须", "成虚像于 \\qty{1.0}{m} 处：$V = 1/\\overline{OA'} - 1/\\overline{OA}", "= -1 + 4 = \\qty{+3.0}{\\delta}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:3}", "$G = 25/4.0 = 6.3$；邮票位于焦平面，", "距透镜 \\qty{4.0}{cm}。尺寸为 \\qty{2}{mm} 的细节，其视角 $\\theta' = 2/40 = \\qty{0.05}{rad}$，", "在 \\qty{25}{cm} 处则为 $2/250 = \\qty{0.008}{rad}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:4}", "$G = 900/25 = 36$ 和 $900/9 = 100$；筒长 $f_1' + f_2' =", "\\qty{925}{mm}$ 和 \\qty{909}{mm}；月球视角：$36 \\times 0.52^\\circ = 19^\\circ$ 和", "$52^\\circ$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:5}", "$\\gamma_1 = -160/4 = -40$；$G_2 = 250/20 = 12.5$；$G = 500$。", "$\\overline{F_1A} = -f_1'^2/\\Delta = -16/160 = \\qty{-0.10}{mm}$：物体", "位于距物镜 \\qty{4.1}{mm} 处。物体须与物镜保持该距离，", "因此整个镜筒移动 \\qty{10}{\\micro m} ---", "这正是细调旋钮的作用。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:6}", "裸眼：$1.5/3\\times10^{-4} = \\qty{5}{km}$。望远镜：$\\theta_{\\min}", "= 1.22 \\times 5.5\\times10^{-7}/0.100 = \\qty{6.7e-6}{rad}$；两车灯", "可分辨的最大间距为 $1.5/6.7\\times10^{-6} \\approx \\qty{220}{km}$（原则上，", "空气和曲率首先起作用）。$G_r = 3\\times10^{-4}/", "6.7\\times10^{-6} = 45$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:7}", "$D = 50/2 = \\qty{25}{mm}$。曝光时间 $\\propto N^2$，故为原来的 $(8/2)^2 = 16$ 倍，", "即 $16/500 \\approx 1/30$~\\unit{s}。它换来了更大的景深（", "并减少像差），代价是产生运动模糊，或需要三脚架。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:8}", "$H = 35^2/(11 \\times 0.03) = \\qty{3.7}{m}$；清晰范围自 $H/2 =", "\\qty{1.9}{m}$ 至无穷远。预设于 $H$ 处，则照相机无需调焦：", "可在场景发生的瞬间拍下画面。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:9}", "$8\\times30$：出瞳 $30/8 = \\qty{3.8}{mm} < \\qty{7}{mm}$，全部光线", "进入眼睛。$7\\times50$：\\qty{7.1}{mm}，与夜间瞳孔相当，", "并多收集 $(50/30)^2 = 2.8$ 倍的光：适合黄昏使用的一对。", "$20\\times30$：出瞳 \\qty{1.5}{mm}，像暗、视场窄，", "手的抖动也被放大二十倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:10}", "隐形眼镜：$f' = \\qty{-25}{cm}$，$V = \\qty{-4.0}{\\delta}$。框架眼镜：", "远点距透镜为 $25 - 1.5 = \\qty{23.5}{cm}$，因此 $f' =", "\\qty{-23.5}{cm}$，$V = \\qty{-4.3}{\\delta}$ --- 光焦度更大。透镜须", "使像成于眼睛的远点，该远点与透镜的距离", "取决于透镜所在的位置。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:11}", "无焦系统：$F_1' = F_2$，间距 $f_1' + f_2' = \\qty{20}{cm}$（短于", "同放大率 $G$ 的开普勒式望远镜的 \\qty{40}{cm}）。$G = -30/(-10) =", "+3$：正立。出瞳 $\\overline{O_2P'} = f_2'(f_1' + f_2')/f_1' =", "-10 \\times 20/30 = \\qty{-6.7}{cm}$：虚像，位于镜筒内、眼睛无法到达之处；", "位于目镜后的眼睛只能接收恰好到达它的光束——", "视场狭窄，这是歌剧", "望远镜的典型缺点。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:optical-instruments:12}", "$(200/7)^2 = 820$；$\\Delta m = 2.5\\log_{10}820 = 7.3$：极限", "星等 $13.3$。通量 $\\propto 1/r^2$，因此灯可被看见的", "距离增至原来的 $\\sqrt{820} = 29$ 倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:optical-instruments:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $F_2 = F_1'$：间距 $f_1' + f_2' = \\qty{1225}{mm}$", "（\\qty{25}{mm} 目镜）或 \\qty{1206}{mm}（\\qty{6}{mm}）。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $L_1$：$\\overline{O_1A_1} = f_1'$（像位于 $F_1'$）。$L_2$：", "$\\overline{O_2A_1} = -f_2'$，故 $1/\\overline{O_2A'} = 1/f_2' + 1/(-f_2')", "= 0$：像位于无穷远。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 光束在公共焦平面上会聚于高度 $h =", "f_1'\\alpha$（过 $O_1$ 的光线）；由此处过 $O_2$ 的光线决定", "出射方向，$\\alpha' = -h/f_2' = -(f_1'/f_2')\\alpha$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $G = -48$ 和 $-200$；月球视角：$25^\\circ$ 和 $104^\\circ$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 天空中没有上下之分；观测望远镜", "需加装一对正像棱镜（或一组透镜中继）。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 在 $L_1$ 的焦平面上，直径 $f_1'\\theta = 1200 \\times", "9.1\\times10^{-3} = \\qty{11}{mm}$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 物 $O_1$ 位于 $\\overline{O_2O_1} = -(f_1' + f_2')$：", "$1/\\overline{O_2P'} = 1/f_2' - 1/(f_1' + f_2') = f_1'/[f_2'(f_1' + f_2')]$；", "放大率 $\\overline{O_2P'}/\\overline{O_2O_1} = -f_2'/f_1' = 1/G$，", "直径为 $D/\\abs G$。", ""]}